		Texy\Modules\FigureModule::solve: 'the method is private; customize the output with a handler registered by `Texy\Texy::addHandler()`'
		Texy\Modules\HeadingModule::solve: 'the method is private; customize the output with a handler registered by `Texy\Texy::addHandler()`'
		Texy\Modules\HeadingModule::beforeParse: 'the method is private; customize the output with a handler registered by `Texy\Texy::addHandler()`'
