		Texy\Modules\HtmlOutputModule::postProcess: 'the method is private; customize the output with a handler registered by `Texy\Texy::addHandler()`'
		Texy\Modules\HtmlOutputModule::wrap: 'the method is private; customize the output with a handler registered by `Texy\Texy::addHandler()`'
		Texy\Modules\HtmlOutputModule::cb: 'the method is private; customize the output with a handler registered by `Texy\Texy::addHandler()`'
		Texy\Modules\ImageModule::beforeParse: 'the method is private; customize the output with a handler registered by `Texy\Texy::addHandler()`'
		Texy\Modules\ImageModule::patternReferenceDef: 'the method is private; customize the output with a handler registered by `Texy\Texy::addHandler()`'
		Texy\Modules\LinkModule::beforeParse: 'the method is private; customize the output with a handler registered by `Texy\Texy::addHandler()`'
		Texy\Modules\LinkModule::patternReferenceDef: 'the method is private; customize the output with a handler registered by `Texy\Texy::addHandler()`'
